{"tid": "ace_oss_15565", "entry": "initialize_layer", "stage1": [6, 8], "stage2": [25, 40], "rate": 0.625, "wilson95": [0.4703, 0.7578], "admitted": true, "why": "in band", "task": {"tid": "ace_oss_15565", "entry": "initialize_layer", "prompt": "You are tasked with implementing a custom neural network layer for a natural language processing (NLP) model. The layer should be able to handle tokenized input and output sequences, with dynamic input and output vocabulary sizes. Your implementation should include a function that initializes a layer with the following parameters: input_vocab_size, output_vocab_size, and emb_dim (the embedding dimension for the encoder). The function should return a dictionary containing the initialized parameters of the layer, including the input dimension, output dimension, and encoder embedding dimension. The output should be in the form of a dictionary: {'input_dim': input_vocab_size, 'output_dim': output_vocab_size, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': emb_dim}.", "tests": ["assert initialize_layer(10, 20, 30) == {'input_dim': 10, 'output_dim': 20, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 30}", "assert initialize_layer(5, 15, 25) == {'input_dim': 5, 'output_dim': 15, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 25}", "assert initialize_layer(100, 200, 300) == {'input_dim': 100, 'output_dim': 200, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 300}", "assert initialize_layer(0, 0, 0) == {'input_dim': 0, 'output_dim': 0, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 0}", "assert initialize_layer(1, 1, 1) == {'input_dim': 1, 'output_dim': 1, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 1}", "assert initialize_layer(50, 100, 150) == {'input_dim': 50, 'output_dim': 100, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 150}", "assert initialize_layer(2, 4, 8) == {'input_dim': 2, 'output_dim': 4, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 8}", "assert initialize_layer(3, 6, 9) == {'input_dim': 3, 'output_dim': 6, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 9}", "assert initialize_layer(7, 14, 21) == {'input_dim': 7, 'output_dim': 14, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 21}", "assert initialize_layer(12, 24, 36) == {'input_dim': 12, 'output_dim': 24, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 36}", "assert initialize_layer(8, 16, 32) == {'input_dim': 8, 'output_dim': 16, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 32}", "assert initialize_layer(4, 8, 12) == {'input_dim': 4, 'output_dim': 8, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 12}", "assert initialize_layer(9, 18, 27) == {'input_dim': 9, 'output_dim': 18, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 27}", "assert initialize_layer(25, 50, 75) == {'input_dim': 25, 'output_dim': 50, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 75}", "assert initialize_layer(30, 60, 90) == {'input_dim': 30, 'output_dim': 60, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 90}", "assert initialize_layer(11, 22, 33) == {'input_dim': 11, 'output_dim': 22, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 33}", "assert initialize_layer(13, 26, 39) == {'input_dim': 13, 'output_dim': 26, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 39}", "assert initialize_layer(15, 30, 45) == {'input_dim': 15, 'output_dim': 30, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 45}", "assert initialize_layer(17, 34, 51) == {'input_dim': 17, 'output_dim': 34, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 51}", "assert initialize_layer(19, 38, 57) == {'input_dim': 19, 'output_dim': 38, 'encoder_embedding_dimension': 57}"]}}
